                        target="#pg472">p. 472</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1151-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1151-f2-content">
                <p>i. e., the Glatzer Neisse or Nysa Kłodzka. See the map facing <ref
                        target="#pg1152">p. 1152</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
